# Bundled static ffmpeg binaries (~200MB, downloaded not authored — see
# bin/FFMPEG-README.txt for the exact build/version and bin/FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt
# for its GPL v3 terms). Each sits just under GitHub's 100MB file limit;
# tracking them in git risks breaking future pushes on any size creep and
# permanently bloats every clone. End users get them via the compiled
# installer (see installer.nsi), not via git clone.
bin/ffmpeg.exe
bin/ffprobe.exe
